{"id":2689,"date":"2026-06-10T13:04:26","date_gmt":"2026-06-10T13:04:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2689"},"modified":"2026-10-02T10:09:10","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T10:09:10","slug":"kota-green-salt-brush-finish-stone","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/kota-green-salt-brush-finish-stone\/","title":{"rendered":"Kota Green Salt Brush Finish Stone"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"688\">Kota Green Salt Brush Finish is a premium natural stone known for its unique textured appearance and elegant green shades. The salt brush treatment enhances the natural beauty of the stone by creating a subtle brushed texture that highlights its authentic character while providing a sophisticated and contemporary look.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"1002\">Widely used in residential, commercial, hospitality, and landscape projects, this finish offers a perfect combination of aesthetics and functionality. Its naturally textured surface adds depth and visual interest, making it an excellent choice for designers and architects seeking a refined natural stone finish.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1329\">The stone blends seamlessly with both modern and traditional architectural styles and is suitable for a variety of applications including flooring, pathways, courtyards, garden areas, terraces, and feature spaces. Its durability, low maintenance requirements, and timeless appeal make it a practical choice for long-term use.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1546\">Combining natural elegance, strength, and versatility, Kota Green Salt Brush Finish remains a preferred option for projects that demand a distinctive natural stone surface with lasting performance and visual appeal.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1551\" \/>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11k4bfl\" data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1578\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1556\" data